
# NB.:
#
# The ampersand "anchors" the keyboard in the Add Card menu.
# e.g. typing "p" will click on "&Program".
#
# Each card-type has a distinct stylesheet (because their frames/layout/etc are all different). It's more convenient to add a new card with the "Add Cards" menu than by the "New Card" button (after which you'd have to go to the blank card's Style tab and change the stylesheet... unless you keep every card in its own .mse-set file).
#
# Has Unicode for "scannability".
#
# 

